# PRE-COMMIT LENS COMPLIANCE CHECK

## Forbidden Imports — REJECT if found:
- `from 'styled-components'`
- `from '@emotion/react'` (except internal Lens use)
- `from '@emotion/styled'` (except internal Lens use)
- `from '@chakra-ui'`
- `from '@mui/'`
- `from 'antd'`
- `from 'react-bootstrap'`
- `from 'react-icons'`
- `from '@heroicons'`
- `from 'lucide-react'`
- `from '@headlessui'`
- `from '@radix-ui'`
- `*.module.css`
- `*.css'`
- `*.scss'`

## Forbidden JSX — REJECT if found:
- Raw HTML: `<div>`, `<span>`, `<p>`, `<h1>-<h6>`, `<button>`,
  `<input>`, `<select>`, `<textarea>`, `<table>`, `<form>`,
  `<img>`, `<ul>`, `<ol>`, `<li>`, `<nav>`, `<header>`,
  `<footer>`, `<section>`, `<aside>`, `<main>`, `<article>`, `<a>`, `<hr>`
- `style={{` with hardcoded values
- className= with custom classes (unless documented Lens component accepts it)

## Wrong Prop Names — CORRECT these:
- `disabled` → `isDisabled`
- `loading` → `hasLoader`
- `as="..."` → `htmlTag="..."`
- `leftIcon` → `iconBefore`
- `rightIcon` → `iconAfter`
- `size="sm"` → `size="small"`
- `size="md"` → `size="medium"`
- `size="lg"` → `size="large"`
- `variant="ghost"` → Does not exist in Lens
- `ref={ref}` → `refHandler={(r) => { ref.current = r }}`
- `padding="4"` → `padding="medium"` or `padding={2}` (number × 8px)
- `gap="2"` → `gap="small"`

## Forbidden Files — NEVER create:
- Any `.css` file
- Any `.scss` file
- Any `.styled.ts` file
- `tailwind.config.*`
